# Sheoldred, the Apocalypse: "Whenever you draw a card, you gain 2 life" and "Whenever an opponent draws a card, they lose
# 2 life" - once per card and for each opponent (CR 603.2). In a three-player game her draw-step triggers cost Bot2 (turn 2)
# and Bot3 (turn 3) 2 each (18). On turn 4 Bot1 draws (+2 = 22) and casts Wheel of Fortune: every player discards their hand
# and draws seven, so Bot1 gains 2 for each of its seven cards (+14 = 36) and Bot2 and Bot3 lose 2 for each of their seven
# (-14 = 4). Turn 1's draw (the first player draws in a game of more than two, CR 103.8a) came before she was there.

